## 🚨 SAME-DAY ACTION NEEDED — `url-tool-capture-flow-v1` (374736)

**The generation guardrail is breaching on `guided-capture`.** This is the playbook's textbook kill condition: a rageclick win *with* a capture-count loss = net loss.

| arm | opened | rage_pct | gen_pct (cumulative) |
|---|---|---|---|
| control | 269 | **10.04%** | 17.84% |
| guided-capture | 135 | **5.93%** (−41% rel) | 19.26% |
| auto-capture | 128 | 9.38% (≈parity) | **55.47%** (3.1× control) |

- **Guardrail breach (guided-capture):** gen_pct fell **below control on 5 of the last 6 days** (06-11→06-16), including **3 zero-generation days despite openers** (06-12: 11 openers/0 gens; 06-13: 6/0; 06-16: 7/0). Recent-6d window: guided gen **11.3%** (6/53) vs control **20.0%** (23/115). Cumulative still barely above control only because of strong early days — this is the CORS-block-strand failure the guardrail column predicted.
- **Primary (rage):** guided is lowest (−41% rel) but **still not significant** (z≈1.39, p≈0.17). Auto's rage is now at parity (improved from wk1's above-control).
- **Decision:** **KILL `guided-capture` arm today.** Keep `auto-capture` vs `control` running ~1 more week — auto is the de-facto net winner (gen 3.1× control, rage parity), but **do not ship** on a non-significant primary. Re-read ~2026-06-24.

